{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10121010","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10121010","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1012101001:0":{"text":"この辺りがバドーゾ山脈です。急いでアルドンじいちゃんを探しましょう。","source_cn":"这一片就是瓦度索山脉了，我们必须尽快找到雅顿老爷子。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD3ADD9F0897C0988","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"この辺りがバドーゾ山脈です。急いでアルドンじいちゃんを探しましょう。","female":"この辺りがバドーゾ山脈です。急いでアルドンじいちゃんを探しましょう。","variant_male_record_index":"110932","variant_female_record_index":"110933","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012101002:0":{"text":"アルドン様は自由気ままなお方だ。一つの場所に長くとどまるのを嫌う。","source_cn":"雅顿贤者素来随性，不喜欢在一个地方停留太久。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D2DEA2EE5F07D25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012101003:0":{"text":"いまだに風便りの返事が来ないなんて、何かあったのだろうか……","source_cn":"发出的风讯至今未回，不知道究竟发生了什么……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF621037C000737D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012101004:0":{"text":"おい、ブライアン……さっきから弱気なことばかり言って。君らしくないぞ？","source_cn":"喂……布莱恩，你怎么回事啊？刚刚启程就说丧气话，这可不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC44517495D840C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012101005:0":{"text":"水の流れに委ねれば、自ずと海へ帰す――自然の成り行きに任せろっていうだろ？ほら、ムスッとしてないで、笑って笑って！","source_cn":"只要顺水而下，终将归于大海——顺其自然的道理你懂吧？快...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA8A8DB2FBBC7B